    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "ダイワスカーレット",
            "enName": "Daiwa Scarlet",
            "jpText": "先輩！　この間のレース、観に来て\r\nくださって、ありがとうございました！",
            "enText": "Excuse me! Thank you very much for taking \ntime to come see my race the other day!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -7221089571597306283,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "ああ、実にいいレースだった。",
            "enText": "Yes, and what an excellent race it was.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 4715814555170051707,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "本番直前で走法を変更したにもかかわらず、\r\n見事に仕上げてきたな。",
            "enText": "I know you changed your running style \nshortly before the race, but you managed \nto pull it off splendidly.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -4309003751559890406,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ダイワスカーレット",
            "enName": "Daiwa Scarlet",
            "jpText": "当然です！　あのアドバイスを\n活かさない手はありませんでしたから！",
            "enText": "Naturally! I would never dare to ignore \nadvice from you of all people!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 1957556984346180976,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "……正直、私の言葉が足枷になって、\n調子を崩してやしないかと心配もした。",
            "enText": "Frankly, I was… worried that my words may \nhave placed a heavy burden on you.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -2670267893612585298,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "だが、とんだ杞憂だったな。\nお前の努力は大したものだ。",
            "enText": "But I see now that there was no \ncause for concern. Your diligence \nis not something to be trifled with.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -3473676195520590017,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "……スカーレット、よくやった。",
            "enText": "…Scarlet, you did well.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 7034183864857902709,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ダイワスカーレット",
            "enName": "Daiwa Scarlet",
            "jpText": "あっ、あっ、ありがとうございますっ！！！",
            "enText": "Th-Th-Thank you so much!!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 8330754660369721758,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ダイワスカーレット",
            "enName": "Daiwa Scarlet",
            "jpText": "……先輩に褒めてもらえたぁ……！",
            "enText": "She praised me…!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -6917856444297051122,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "……ふっ。",
            "enText": "…Heh.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
